<title>TURKEY: Turkey to sell part of Eregli stake.</title>
<headline>Turkey to sell part of Eregli stake.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's Privatisation Administration OIB on Wednesday put on sale a 30 to 40 percent stake in flat steel producer Eregli Demir ve Celik Fabrikalari through newspaper advertisements.</p>
<p>Bids will be collected until January 27, 1997.</p>
<p>The OIB holds a 51.66 percent stake in 6,336 billion lira-capital of Eregli which has a production capacity of three million tons/year and market share of 46 percent.</p>
<p>--Istanbul newsroom +90-212-2750875</p>
</text>
